from me and swims away.

00:23:02.146 --> 00:23:05.784 line:0%
We can still see the bull shark
patrolling around the wreck.

00:23:05.884 --> 00:23:08.286 line:0%
So, we need to get back up
to the surface

00:23:08.386 --> 00:23:09.688 line:0%
as quickly as we can.

00:23:18.596 --> 00:23:21.132 line:0%
And so, it's clear
that introducing food

00:23:21.232 --> 00:23:25.870 line:0%
into the equation, it triggers
that grouper feeding behavior.

00:23:25.970 --> 00:23:28.506 line:0%
So, now, I can see that video
in a different way when that

00:23:28.606 --> 00:23:31.108 line:0%
grouper, what it looks like
it's attacking the diver,

00:23:31.208 --> 00:23:35.413 line:0%
it's actually just going after
the food that that diver has.

00:23:35.513 --> 00:23:38.717 line:0%
That's a clue that these grouper
may not be the monsters

00:23:38.817 --> 00:23:40.751 line:0%
