make them out to be.

00:23:40.851 --> 00:23:44.755 line:0%
They're not searching out big
prey or treating humans as food.

00:23:44.855 --> 00:23:47.292 line:0%
They're detecting
small or injured fish

00:23:47.392 --> 00:23:50.462 line:0%
using their lateral line
like most other fish species.

00:23:57.936 --> 00:24:01.239 line:0%
I've yet to catch a fully
grown goliath grouper.

00:24:01.339 --> 00:24:04.475 line:0%
But I've learned these fish only
inhabit certain structures

00:24:04.575 --> 00:24:08.947 line:0%
and rarely move, so I'm gonna
need Tom's help to find a giant.

00:24:09.781 --> 00:24:12.751 line:0%
He's one of the only people on
the west coast who's permitted

00:24:12.851 --> 00:24:15.520 line:0%
