local grouper hang outs.

00:24:19.557 --> 00:24:22.994 line:0%
This is my opportunity to try
and catch the biggest goliath

00:24:23.094 --> 00:24:26.264 line:0%
grouper I can find and collect
data for local scientists

00:24:26.364 --> 00:24:27.432 line:0%
