00:28:49.761 --> 00:28:51.862 line:0%
It's coming up, it's coming up.

00:28:51.962 --> 00:28:55.899 line:0%
♪ [MUSIC] ♪

00:28:56.000 --> 00:28:57.001 line:0%
A grouper.

00:28:57.101 --> 00:28:58.837 line:0%
