in the estuary, somewhere safe,

00:29:46.784 --> 00:29:49.320 line:0%
starting to maybe now, get
a little bit more bold,

00:29:49.420 --> 00:29:52.256 line:0%
venturing into deeper water.

00:29:52.356 --> 00:29:55.459 line:0%
Four feet, two inches and
now, we wanna get it tagged.

00:29:55.559 --> 00:29:58.029 line:0%
♪ [MUSIC] ♪

00:29:58.129 --> 00:29:59.163 line:0%
Okay, it's tagged.

00:29:59.263 --> 00:30:02.834 line:0%
Tag number five seven five four.

00:30:02.934 --> 00:30:06.236 line:0%
This isn't my big grouper,
but it's a big clue.

00:30:06.336 --> 00:30:10.174 line:0%
Catching a juvenile and not a
giant is a sign that fully grown

00:30:10.274 --> 00:30:13.478 line:0%
