offshore to spawn.

00:30:16.914 --> 00:30:20.551 line:0%
And so, the best chance for a
really big fish is offshore?

00:30:20.651 --> 00:30:21.618 line:0%
TOM MCLAUGHLIN: Most
of those big fish,

00:30:21.719 --> 00:30:24.789 line:0%
