spawning right now.

00:30:24.889 --> 00:30:26.924 line:0%
ZEB HOGAN: We're just gonna hold
him upright, he's swimming,

00:30:27.024 --> 00:30:29.827 line:0%
you can see the tail moving.

00:30:29.927 --> 00:30:30.728 line:0%
He's ready to go.

00:30:30.828 --> 00:30:35.233 line:0%
♪ [MUSIC] ♪

00:30:35.333 --> 00:30:35.833 line:0%
Awesome.

00:30:35.933 --> 00:30:41.472 line:0%
♪ [MUSIC] ♪

00:30:41.572 --> 00:30:43.808 line:0%
Tom thinks that the giant
grouper might be spawning

00:30:43.908 --> 00:30:44.875 line:0%
