00:31:00.591 --> 00:31:04.161 line:0%
And there's one place
Tom wants to check first.

00:31:04.261 --> 00:31:05.529 line:0%
So, where are we
headed right now?

00:31:05.629 --> 00:31:07.164 line:0%
TOM MCLAUGHLIN: Here's
our boat right here,

00:31:07.265 --> 00:31:08.766 line:0%
we're headed towards the wreck.

00:31:08.866 --> 00:31:11.436 line:0%
It's a giant freighter that
sunk, it's upside down,

00:31:11.536 --> 00:31:14.939 line:0%
