here is the bottom.

00:31:18.709 --> 00:31:21.312 line:0%
This blip, right below
us, is the wreck,

00:31:21.412 --> 00:31:24.115 line:0%
and then a big school of fish
hanging out above the wreck.

00:31:24.215 --> 00:31:27.385 line:0%
This big school of fish might
be the aggregation of giants

00:31:27.485 --> 00:31:28.686 line:0%
