00:31:29.854 --> 00:31:32.824 line:0%
But there's only one
way I can know for sure.

00:31:34.759 --> 00:31:37.261 line:0%
I drop into the water and
the clarity is not good,

00:31:37.361 --> 00:31:38.763 line:0%
