00:31:42.333 --> 00:31:45.536 line:0%
I'm swimming along,
looking in portholes.

00:31:45.636 --> 00:31:46.670 line:0%
No grouper.

00:31:46.770 --> 00:31:47.772 line:0%
Looking into cracks.

00:31:47.872 --> 00:31:49.940 line:0%
No grouper.

00:31:50.040 --> 00:31:51.408 line:0%
Maybe this was a false alarm.

00:31:51.508 --> 00:31:53.811 line:0%
Maybe there aren't
any fish down here.

00:31:59.717 --> 00:32:04.688 line:0%
And then, as I come around
the front of the boat

00:32:04.788 --> 00:32:07.958 line:0%
