fish on earth.

00:32:26.310 --> 00:32:34.552 line:0%
♪ [MUSIC] ♪

00:32:34.652 --> 00:32:37.988 line:0%
You only see something like
this, a few places in the world.

00:32:38.088 --> 00:32:39.157 line:0%
And here they are.

00:32:39.257 --> 00:32:41.892 line:0%
All of these goliath grouper
right in front of me.

00:32:41.992 --> 00:32:44.028 line:0%
Ready to spawn
with the new moon.

00:32:44.128 --> 00:32:58.876 line:0%
♪ [MUSIC] ♪

00:32:58.976 --> 00:33:01.379 line:0%
Man that was one of the
coolest things I've ever seen.

00:33:01.479 --> 00:33:05.315 line:0%
Nothing could really prepare
