00:33:06.984 --> 00:33:09.687 line:0%
Fifteen giant
grouper all together.

00:33:09.787 --> 00:33:13.458 line:0%
♪ [MUSIC] ♪

00:33:13.558 --> 00:33:15.759 line:0%
I've struck gold!

00:33:15.859 --> 00:33:19.530 line:0%
Now, that I've found where
the true giants are hiding,

00:33:19.630 --> 00:33:21.566 line:0%
it's time to catch one!

00:33:36.614 --> 00:33:40.250 line:0%
TOM MCLAUGHLIN: Yep, as fast
